  "description": "Battery Disconnect Switch with LED Voltage Display, Brass... - Distributed/Packaged by Maaran Power Tech. Product Details: Battery Disconnect Switch with LED Voltage Display, Brass... - Distributed/Packaged by Maaran Power Tech. Product Details: Battery Disconnect Switch with LED Voltage Display, Brass Terminal (Xtra Large, Disconnect Switch With LED) - Distributed/Packaged by Maaran Power Tech. Product Details: Keep your vehicle's battery in check with this robust battery disconnect switch featuring a built-in LED voltmeter display. Designed for cars, trucks, boats, and other vehicles, this all-in-one device allows you to easily cut off the battery connection with a simple turn of the red knob, helping prevent parasitic drain when your vehicle is parked for extended periods. The bright LED digital display provides a real-time voltage reading, so you can monitor your battery's health at a glance. Constructed with durable brass terminals and a sturdy black housing, this switch is built to withstand the demands of everyday automotive use. The secure bolt-on clamp ensures a firm connection to your battery terminal, while the included spanner makes installation straightforward and hassle-free. Ideal for preventing theft, avoiding battery drain, and ensuring safety during maintenance work, this battery disconnect switch is a practical and reliable addition to any vehicle owner's toolkit.",
